<div>
  <% if notice.present? %>
    <p class="py-2 px-3 bg-green-50 mb-10 text-green-500 font-medium rounded-md inline-block" id="notice"><%= notice %></p>
  <% end %>
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
    Welcome to Christian Journal!
  </h1>
  <p class="text-lg">
    This is a simple journal application built with Ruby on Rails. You can create, edit, and
    delete journal entries to keep track of your thoughts and reflections.<br><br>
    You can also keep track of prayer requests and questions you may have for God or the bible.
  </p>
</div>
